              "id": 18104348,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 151.0\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14j2TBmE9w/\n2. Hover the video so that the video controls are triggered\n3. Observe the timeline bar\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nVideo starts from 00:00 or 00:01\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nVideo skips the first 5-6 seconds\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/222407",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
